227	    /**
228	     * When no registration date is supplied, default it to the server's current date, then roll
229	     * the effective date forward onto a business day: a Saturday or Sunday becomes the following
230	     * Monday. Running on {@link PrePersist} keeps both invariants true for every create path
231	     * (any controller, bulk import or test fixture) rather than a single entry point. The roll is
232	     * idempotent, so a date already adjusted by a caller is left unchanged.
233	     */
234	    @PrePersist
235	    protected void onCreate() {
236	        this.registrationDate = BusinessDays.effectiveRegistrationDate(this.registrationDate);
237	    }
238	
239	    /**
240	     * The single derived key behind all duplicate detection: the normalized telephone, the
241	     * (lower-cased) email or an empty string when absent, and the household id or an empty string
242	     * when absent, joined with {@code '|'} (e.g. {@code +61412345678||H-3F5A9C2E}). Because the
